+ * hrtimer in host time, and the VMX preemption timer too, because
+ * vmx_set_hv_timer() converts the guest deadline to a *host* TSC deadline
+ * through the old ratio.  The hv timer also needs .target_expiration
+ * rescaled even though it does not read it: a halting vCPU moves to the
+ * hrtimer (kvm_lapic_switch_to_sw_timer), and start_sw_period() arms that
+ * at .target_expiration.  Left stale, an in-flight one-shot on Intel fires
+ * new/old times late (a raise) or early (a drop) at the guest's next HLT.
+ */
